      ],
      "en": "Yes, truth is lacking; and he who departs from evil makes himself a prey. The LORD saw it, and it displeased him that there was no justice.",
      "ko": "성실이 없어지므로 악을 떠나는 자가 탈취를 당하는도다 여호와께서 이를 감찰하시고 그 공평이 없은 것을 기뻐 아니하시고",
      "source_text_hash": "af4859ba2d3fe9962e15deda5c677de129935b33a14b8c52af97c3ea71e51cab",
      "translation_text_hash": "8e5098119045e8e208632e07172ccd0b6ec115a1d50801e75ecce8431f691d44",
