      "en": "According to their deeds, he will repay as appropriate: wrath to his adversaries, recompense to his enemies. He will repay the islands their due.",
      "ko": "그들의 행위대로 갚으시되 그 대적에게 분노하시며 그 원수에게 보응하시며 섬들에게 보복하실 것이라",
      "source_text_hash": "7f342f86766bb845113fd0528da768f1fcb970db1378b337632ad73f0ec10ad4",
      "translation_text_hash": "1d33e799e0403a0eba24570cc5e486cc0c4a72b1732a5ea5ef84d035d7a8ce21",
