      "en": "“A Redeemer will come to Zion, and to those who turn from disobedience in Jacob,” says the LORD.",
      "ko": "여호와께서 가라사대 구속자가 시온에 임하며 야곱 중에 죄과를 떠나는 자에게 임하리라",
      "source_text_hash": "8ba2d5d66954de583d0b1a41e66d8229ae4271fd8d5595d84b465a5caa8350a3",
      "translation_text_hash": "09294b78d2841a0621c1001508a84694a74e2c5d3187229bfd8c28d55a781029",
      "translation_policy": "krv-1961-source-mapped",
